{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "code-format-bytes",
  "category": "code",
  "title": "修复字节单位采用十进制进位的问题",
  "instruction": "请只修改 src/solution.py 完成“修复字节单位采用十进制进位的问题”，保持函数签名和调用方输入不变。不要修改 tests/check.py。实现后运行白名单命令 python tests/check.py，并创建 out/change-report.md，写明具体根因、修改方案、边界条件和真实测试结果。验收规则：KiB 使用 1024 字节进位。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "path": "src/solution.py",
      "content": "def format_kib(size):\n    return round(size / 1000, 2)\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "tests/check.py",
      "content": "from pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1] / \"src\"))\nfrom solution import format_kib\n\nassert format_kib(1024) == 1 and format_kib(2048) == 2\nprint(\"PASS-17\")\n"
    }
  ],
  "allow_read": [
    "src/**",
    "tests/**"
  ],
  "allow_write": [
    "src/**",
    "out/**"
  ],
  "allow_commands": [
    "python tests/check.py"
  ],
  "expected_artifacts": [
    "out/change-report.md"
  ],
  "checkers": [
    {
      "type": "command_check",
      "command": "python tests/check.py",
      "cwd": null,
      "expect_exit": 0,
      "stdout_contains": [
        "PASS-17"
      ],
      "stdout_not_contains": [],
      "timeout_secs": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "text": "## 根因"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "text": "## 修复方案"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "text": "## 边界条件"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "text": "## 测试结果"
    },
    {
      "type": "not_contains",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "text": "TODO"
    },
    {
      "type": "regex",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "pattern": "^# "
    },
    {
      "type": "line_count_min",
      "path": "out/change-report.md",
      "min_lines": 9
    }
  ],
  "timeout_secs": 900,
  "max_model_calls": 64,
  "reference_outputs": {
    "out/change-report.md": "# 修复报告：修复字节单位采用十进制进位的问题\n\n## 根因\n\n根据源代码与失败用例说明实际缺陷及其触发条件。\n\n## 修复方案\n\n说明具体实现以及保持不变的公开接口。\n\n## 边界条件\n\nKiB 使用 1024 字节进位。\n\n## 测试结果\n\n运行 python tests/check.py，实际输出 PASS-17。\n",
    "src/solution.py": "def format_kib(size):\n    return round(size / 1024, 2)\n"
  }
}
